  "title": "German Schwenkbraten",
  "description": "Pork chops are marinated for a full day before grilling in this tasty German Schwenkbraten recipe. Serve pork in rolls with onions on top.",
  "authors": [
    "Kimberly McCutcheon-Seabolt"
  ],
